			"widgets_values":[
				"subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the character in <Picture 1>, whose facial identity, hairstyle, body type, and clothing are fully defined by the reference image and must be preserved throughout the target video.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is an 8-second three-shot park scene of <Subject 1> running toward the camera and speaking the line defined in spoken_dialogue. <Subject 1>'s appearance is generated entirely from <Picture 1>. No background music.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the face, hair, body proportions, and outfit from <Picture 1> are retained without alteration.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video has a bright, energetic morning-park style: soft morning sunlight through green trees, a clean jogging path, natural handheld tracking, lively but realistic movement. No music-video style cutting.\n[Shot 1] 00:00.000–00:03.000: A wide-to-medium tracking shot on a park jogging path. <Subject 1>, exactly matching <Picture 1> in face, hair, and outfit, runs from the distance toward the camera. Arms swing naturally, breathing steady, footsteps light on the path. Trees and blurred morning exercisers in the background. The camera retreats smoothly to keep <Subject 1> centered as the figure gets closer.\n[Shot 2] 00:03.000–00:05.000: Cut to a medium shot. <Subject 1> keeps running toward the camera, slows slightly, wipes sweat or adjusts breathing, and looks directly at the camera with a bright, confident smile, ready to speak. Morning light catches the face.\n[Shot 3] 00:05.000–00:08.000: Cut to a medium close-up, frontal. <Subject 1> slows to a stop or jogs in place, looks straight into the camera, and speaks the line specified in spoken_dialogue once only, in Mandarin. Tone is energetic, firm, and encouraging. After speaking, <Subject 1> gives a small nod and smile, breathing slightly fast but happy. The camera holds steady.\n\nspoken_dialogue:\n<Subject 1> (Mandarin, energetic, firm, encouraging, say this line exactly once and do not repeat it): “锻炼身体要持之以恒，不能三天打鱼两天晒网”\nNo other dialogue.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nDiegetic sound only. Morning park ambience throughout: birds chirping, leaves rustling in a light breeze, footsteps on the jogging path, steady breathing, faint distant voices of other exercisers. In Shot 3, the spoken line from spoken_dialogue is heard once, clear and centered. No music, no background music, no score.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone. Do not generate any background music, instrumental beat, or score."
